            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mu ngila ng'eneyo, enyuma we siakhulia abukula sikoombe, aaloma ali, “Sikoombe sino sili endakaano embia, eyichusiibwe khubirira mu mafuki kase. Mu siise siosi siosi ne munywaamo, khola muri khu khuukhebulila ese.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sikila mu siise siosi siosi kano kekesia kali buli lwoosi ne mulia kumukaati kuno lundi ne munywa mu sikoombe sino mwilwachanga lifwa lio Mwami khukhwola nga akheeche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khwako, omundu yesi yesi nalia kumukaati kwo Mwami, namwe nanywa khukhwama mu sikoombe siewe mu ngila eye khulekha khumuria tawe, aba aakholeele bubwoni kumubili ne kamafuki ko Mwami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono, buli mundu akhoyeele anyoe emenieelesie omwene, nio alie kumukaati ne khunywa mu sikoombe sio Mwami ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sikila aaba bali omundu sanyala amanya nilio kumubili kwo Mwami kwekisia tawe, nga alia kumukaati ne khunywa mu sikoombe, aba ereerera omwene bukhalaki nga nalia ne khunywa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ako kakila bakali mwinywe ne bali batekhele lundi balwaale, lundi bakali bafwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanga khunyoanga khwimenieelesia fwabeene, andi Wele se akhukhalakilanga tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali omwami akhukhalakilanga ne khu khuelesia efwe siiukuumo khube balayi, nio khukheecha khwakhalakilwa alala ne sibala tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khwako bawandaayase, ne mwibuusia alala khulia, buli mulala akhoyeele aliinde owasie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne mulala khwinywe aaba nali ne njala, akhoyeele alie engo wewe, nio Wele akhamukhalakila enywe ne mukhung'aana tawe. Ne khu makhuwa kakaandi ako, khakaluungisie ne nichile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
